=== p-adic 2-cycle structure ===

For each known 2-cycle {a, b}:
  - vp(a - b) for p in 2,3,5,7,11
  - vp(a + b) 
  - vp(a*b)  
  - vp(F_3(a->b)) = ord_p(1 + a^2 + b^2)
  - vp(a^2 - b^2) = vp(a-b) + vp(a+b)

